timeline.body:
Idea: This code block is very hard to read (at least for me) and the variable is very long.
Maybe we could extract it into a Utility method and call that in L4196?

I think a method would also be nicer because we could do something like this:
```java
// If it's a video livestream -> do trackselector stuff
if (streamType == StreamType.LIVE_STREAM && sourceType == SourceType.LIVE_STREAM) {
   return true;
}

// If it's
// * a video with separated audio
// * OR a video with audio only THAT has no audio streams
// -> go on
if (sourceType == SourceType.VIDEO_WITH_SEPARATED_AUDIO
                || (sourceType == SourceType.VIDEO_WITH_AUDIO_OR_AUDIO_ONLY
                        && isNullOrEmpty(info.getAudioStreams())) {
   // If it's a video stream or a live stream -> do trackselector stuff
   if (streamType == StreamType.VIDEO_STREAM || streamType == StreamType.LIVE_STREAM) {
      return true;
   }
}

// default
return false
```

