I hate nested ``{ }`` - in my opinion they make the code more complex and you can end up with a lot of indentations.

So maybe do a (quick exit style)
```
if (mappedTrackInfo == null) {
  return RENDERER_UNAVAILABLE; 
}
```
here instead.

